              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this with Splenda. I don't have an ice cream maker so I buzzed this in my blender and froze this in a freezer container until it was solid, then reblended it and froze it again. Very good! My kids and I really liked this."
          },
          {
