            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Caltvedt"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used 1/4 cup of light sugar (Dominos sugar and stevia mix). Also added 2T of vodka to prevent freezing too hard. It came out nice and tart, almost as good as Trader Joe's plain frozen yogurt. I used a Cuisinart ice cream maker, and it was ready much faster than regular ice cream.",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-11T13:48:16.837Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lila sanders"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have a mini ice cream maker and I used a 5.3 oz serving of Greek coconut yogurt, a 1/4 cup coconut milk and 1/2 TBS flavored vodka. It turned out very well. I love my mini ice cream freezer. I can make frozen yogurt every day!",
            "datePublished": "2021-01-06T16:27:56.743Z"
          },
          {
