            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mary Elizabeth"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make mine with honey instead of sugar. You can't tell a difference in the taste, and it ends up with this beautiful, golden tint to it. You don't have to have an ice-cream maker. Just stir it up well and freeze overnight. I like to satisfy my sweet tooth with this easy, healthy treat! Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2013-05-22T18:18:15.690Z"
          },
          {
