              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PerkyCream1866"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This turned out great. I added three mashed bananas and reduced the sugar to 1/3 cup. I will try other fruits also, figs should be ripe soon. The best part is there are no preservatives or strange ingredients or artificial colors.",
            "datePublished": "2023-07-16T11:05:17.151Z"
