            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "woodquail"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had some chocolate chip cookies that weren't up to my standards..I crushed them up fine in the food processor and added Greek vanilla yogurt, a drizzle of vodka and a little Truvia granular sweetener.\nI was following instructions of other reviewers. I froze the mixture and then gave it a spin in the processor and refroze it. Oh, Yummm!",
