            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Monica McKelvy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Dang! This one's good! I used homemade greek yogurt and substituted honey for sugar (1 for 1 substitute), and it's divine! It's not icy at all. It's smooth and creamy. The texture is great the taste is great. This will probably become a summer family favorite.",
            "datePublished": "2025-02-06T03:17:20.260Z"
          },
          {
